Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.14,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡JASON, DEFIÉNDEME!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Esos tipos se están\Npeleando.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Tengo que ver esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Uy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Se están dando duro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Yo le voy al de la camisa\Nazul oscuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:08.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ese gana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Uy, te crees muy rudo,\N¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:14.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Jason, defiéndeme!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Sí,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}sí, métete ahí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Tengo novio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:20.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te va a romper la cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Vamos, Jason!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Eso! Sí, así es.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dos contra uno!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:29.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Métete con alguien de tu\Ntamaño, idiota.
